<title>HONG KONG: Robert Fleming sets Hutchison warrants.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming sets Hutchison warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd said on Wednesday it intends to issue 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$61.50     PREMIUM	 12.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.784     GEARING	 7.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.NOV.97    PAYDATE	 10.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$61.50</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
